            <p class="text-justify"><strong>I.</strong><br /> The parties undertake to enter into a real estate purchase agreement for the object indicated above, at the price indicated in this Reservation Form.</p>
            <p class="text-justify"><strong>II.</strong><br /> When signing the Reservation Form, it will be necessary to have paid 15,000 CHF, which will be deducted from the purchase price. This amount is not refundable.<br/>Applicable fees for cost of purchase taxes are 1.5% of the purchase price.</p>
            <p class="text-justify" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong>III.</strong><br /> Within 5 business days after signing the Reservation Form, the purchasing party shall proceed with the payment of the reservation fee in the amount of 10% of total purchase price, after deducting the 15,000 CHF paid in advance, to the following bank details:</p>
            <strong>Heading:</strong> Andermatt Post Hotel AG<br />
            <strong>Bank:</strong> Raiffeisen <br />
            <strong>IBAN:</strong> CH3780808004894507888 <br />
            <strong>SWIFT/BIC:</strong> RAIFCH23 <br />
            <strong>CURRENCY:</strong> CHF
            <br /><br />
            <strong>Bank Name:</strong> Emirates NBD PJSC<br />
            <strong>Account Name:</strong> M I R A DEVELOPMENTS LLC <br />
            <strong>Account Number:</strong> 1025816055106<br />
            <strong>IBAN:</strong> AE030260001025816055106 <br />
            <strong>SWIFT Code:</strong> EBILAEADXXX
            <p class="text-justify">In case of non-payment by the specified deadline, the reserved item will be put back on the market without 
                further notice. Reservation is confirmed only upon receipt of the 10% of the reservation fee. 
                If there are multiple confirmations of reservation of the same object, priority will be determined chronologically, 
                i.e. by the timing of receipt of the deposit.  
                Payment of the amount of the reservation fee shall be made from an account in the personal name of the 
                purchasing party.
            </p>
            <p class="text-justify"><strong>IV.</strong><br /> The public notarial deed will be signed, at the invitation of the selling party, before the appointed Swiss Notary Public, within two months after the payment of 10% of the total purchase price. Condition for the signing of the public deed is the payment of another 10% on the total purchase price in addition to the 10% paid at the signing of the reservation (total amount 20% of the total purchase price). In case of failure to finalize the real estate purchase agreement (Public Deed) in a 2-month period from the signature of the Reservation, Andermatt Post Hotel AG will keep the amount paid by the Purchase Party as management and operating expenses.
            </p>
            <p class="text-justify"><strong>V.</strong><br /> Swiss law shall apply to this reservation contract.  
                The place of jurisdiction for both parties is the place of situation of the real estate property, namely Andermatt 
                (Uri).
            </p>
            <p class="text-justify"><strong>VI.</strong><br /> Place and date: ___________________________________________________________</p>
            <p class="text-justify"><strong>VII.</strong><br /> Signatures</p><br />
            <div class="row-div">
                <div class="column-div" style="width: 35%;">______________________________________</div>
                <div class="column-div" style="width: 35%; text-align: center;">______________________________________</div>
                <div class="column-div" style="width: 30%; text-align: center;">______________________________________</div>
            </div>
            <div class="row-div">
                <div class="column-div" style="width: 35%;">Buyer</div>
                <div class="column-div" style="width: 35%;">Co-Buyer</div>
                <div class="column-div" style="width: 30%;">Andermatt Post Hotel AG</div>
            </div><br />
            <div class="row-div">
                <div class="column-div" style="width: 35%;">Are you being assisted by any of Vendor`s registered agents: {!IF(oppData['Opportunity'].Assisted_by_agent__c == true, 'Yes', 'No')}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="row-div">
                <div class="column-div" style="width: 35%;">Agency`s Name: {!oppData['Opportunity'].Agency__r.Name}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="row-div">
                <div class="column-div" style="width: 35%;">Agency Representative Name: {!oppData['Opportunity'].Agent__r.Name}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="row-div">
                <div class="column-div" style="width: 35%;">Agency Representative Signature: _________________________________________</div>
            </div><br />
            <div class="row-div">
                <div class="column-div" style="width: 35%;">Sales advisor name &amp; signature: _________________________________________</div>
            </div>
            <div class="row-div">
                <div class="column-div" style="width: 35%;"><strong>{!oppData['Opportunity'].Owner.Name}</strong></div>
            </div>
            <p><strong>Documents to attach:</strong></p>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 3px;">Photocopy of an identity document (valid ID card or passport).</p>
            <p class="text-justify" style="font-style: italic; font-size: 11px;">We process personal data in accordance with the requirements of the Swiss Federal Data Protection Act (hereinafter: "DPA") and if, to the extent 
                applicable, in accordance with the European Union General Data Protection Regulation (hereinafter: "GDPR"). If we deem it appropriate, we may provide 
                the acquiring party with additional privacy policies. At the following web address you will find the full privacy policy and all contact detail: [•]</p>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>
</apex:page>